# ==============================================================================================
#  .gitignore -- AvatarForge
# ==============================================================================================
#  Rule of thumb for this repository: source, documentation and test tooling are tracked; anything
#  that a documented command can regenerate is not. Every ignored directory below is produced by
#  `tools/build_host.sh`, `tools/build_android.sh` or `tools/build_gradle.sh`, and BUILD.md says
#  which command regenerates it.
#
#  Deliberately NOT ignored (tracked, because they are the contract or the evidence of it):
#    abi/afcore.abi.json   the generated ABI manifest is checked in on purpose - the conformance
#                          tool diffs against it, so a change to the header must show up as a diff
#    abi/                  in this repository, not as a silent regeneration
# ==============================================================================================

# ---- host build (tools/build_host.sh) ---------------------------------------------------------
build-host/

# ---- Android native build (tools/build_android.sh) --------------------------------------------
build-android/
build-android-*.log

# ---- Rust (cargo) -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
rust/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# ---- Gradle / Android SDK ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.gradle/
**/build/
local.properties
*.iml
.idea/
captures/
*.hprof

# ---- signing material: never in a repository ----------------------------------------------
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# ---- build logs (the commands are documented; the logs are noise) -----------------------------
*.log

# ---- generated binaries: TRACKED BY DECISION --------------------------------------------------
# prebuilt/ and artifacts/ are deliberately committed. They are build outputs, but they are also
# the deliverables: someone cloning this repository can install the APK, open the sample .glb, or
# build the app without an NDK, which matters more here than a tidy diff.
#
# The cost, stated plainly: ~65 MB in history (of which the sample model is 34 MB), and a new
# blob for every rebuild rather than a small diff. To stop tracking them later:
#     git rm -r --cached prebuilt artifacts   # and add the patterns back here
# Everything else that a documented command regenerates stays ignored.
out/

# ---- OS / editor cruft ------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
google_drive/
